---
import "../styles/global.css";
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead
      title="Privacy Policy — gelatincalculator.com"
      description="Privacy policy for gelatincalculator.com. We collect no personal data and set no cookies of our own. Google AdSense and Google Fonts are loaded on our pages."
      path="/privacy/"
    />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-white text-stone-900">
    <nav class="border-b border-stone-200">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
        <a href="/" class="font-serif text-xl text-stone-900">gelatincalculator.com</a>
        <div class="flex gap-5 text-sm text-stone-600">
          <a href="/about" class="hover:text-amber-700">About</a>
          <a href="/privacy" class="text-amber-700">Privacy</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-5 py-16">
      <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl text-stone-900 mb-4">Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 mb-8">Last updated: September 2, 2026</p>

      <div class="text-stone-700 leading-relaxed space-y-5">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-900 mt-6 mb-2">
          What we collect
        </h2>
        <p>
          gelatincalculator.com does not ask you for personal data and keeps
          no database of its own. There are no accounts, no sign-up, no
          newsletter, and no contact form. We set no cookies of our own, and
          we do not use localStorage, sessionStorage, or any first-party
          analytics or tracking script. The one exception is the routine
          request logging our hosting provider performs on every site it
          serves, described under Server logs below.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every page is static HTML, CSS, and JavaScript served from a
          content delivery network. The calculator runs entirely in your
          browser: the numbers and selections you enter are never
          transmitted to us or to anyone else, are never stored, and are
          discarded when you close the tab.
        </p>
        <p>
          That describes what <em>we</em> do, which is not the whole
          picture. Pages on this site load two third-party resources from
          Google — the AdSense advertising script and the Google Fonts
          stylesheet — and Google may set its own cookies or read device
          information when those load. That is separate from our own data
          collection and is described in the Advertising and Third parties
          sections below.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-900 mt-8 mb-2">
          Server logs
        </h2>
        <p>
          Our hosting provider (Cloudflare Pages) records standard HTTP
          request logs that include IP address, user agent, and the page
          requested. These logs are retained per Cloudflare's standard
          policies and are used only for abuse prevention and operational
          troubleshooting. We do not run any additional analytics on top of
          these logs.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-900 mt-8 mb-2">
          Advertising
        </h2>
        <p>
          This site is being reviewed by Google AdSense. The AdSense
          JavaScript snippet (<code>pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js</code>)
          is loaded on every page so Google can review the site for approval.
          Once approved, ads will be served automatically by Google's Auto
          Ads system.
        </p>
        <p>When ads are served, Google may use cookies and similar technologies to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 ml-4">
          <li>Serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this site or other sites</li>
          <li>Personalize advertising based on browsing behavior</li>
          <li>Measure ad performance and prevent fraud</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting{" "}
          <a class="text-amber-700 underline underline-offset-4" href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads">
            Google's Ads Settings
          </a>
          . You can learn more about how Google uses data when you use partner
          sites or apps at{" "}
          <a class="text-amber-700 underline underline-offset-4" href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">
            policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites
          </a>
          .
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not control which specific ads are shown and we do not have
          access to individual user browsing data through AdSense.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-900 mt-8 mb-2">
          Third parties
        </h2>
        <p>
          The site loads the Google Fonts typefaces "DM Serif Display" and
          "Inter" from fonts.googleapis.com. Google's own privacy policy
          applies to that font request, which — like any web request —
          discloses your IP address and browser user agent to Google.
          Aside from Google Fonts, the Google AdSense script described in
          the Advertising section above, and the hosting CDN, no other
          third-party services are called from our pages.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-900 mt-8 mb-2">
          Children's privacy
        </h2>
        <p>
          This site is a general-audience cooking reference. It is not
          directed at children, and we do not knowingly collect personal
          information from anyone, children included. We have no way to
          identify the age of a visitor, and we ask for no information that
          would reveal it. What Google may collect through the advertising
          script is governed by Google's own policies, linked above.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-900 mt-8 mb-2">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about privacy? Email{" "}
          <!--email_off--><a class="text-amber-700 underline underline-offset-4" href="mailto:vetorainfo@gmail.com">
            vetorainfo@gmail.com
          </a><!--/email_off-->
          .
        </p>
      </div>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
